# Local development secrets (gitignored). Copy to `.dev.vars` and fill in real
# development-only values. Never commit `.dev.vars`. Production uses
# `wrangler secret put` (set manually by a human, never automated).

# Telegram bot token from BotFather (Phase 2+). Required for the webhook reply path.
# TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=

# Webhook secret sent as X-Telegram-Bot-Api-Secret-Token (Phase 2+).
# Must match the secret_token registered via setWebhook.
# TELEGRAM_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
